## Scope and limits

This model was trained under ADR 0006 (landmark-based classifier) and
ADR 0008 (public-data-only training for slice 1). Specifically:

- Training clips drawn from WLASL only (MS-ASL pending license).
- No clips authored by the project team — see ADR 0008.
- Vocabulary curated by hearing engineers from public sources (ADR 0004).
- Slice-2 production-deployment work involves paid Deaf-instructor
  review of every sign + hint and instructor-recorded training
  supplements; that work has not happened for this version.

