## Honest disclosure

Per `docs/PEDAGOGY.md` §8 and ADRs 0004 + 0008, the system claims
only what it can defend:

- The pedagogical architecture (spaced retrieval, mastery-based exit,
  three-layer hints, eval gate, local inference) is the substance
  under evaluation.
- The recognition model itself is pilot-grade trained on public data
  only, without Deaf-signer review of training-data correctness.
- Slice-2 production-deployment work (paid Deaf-instructor engagement
  per ADR 0004) is the route under which the data-authorship limit
  is addressed.
